<tt>String</tt>
</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
        <div><a name="_standardhierarchicalsection" id="_standardhierarchicalsection"></a><h2>7.10<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>StandardHierarchicalSection</h2><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_d6565078-08a1-4b29-b311-2fc28daf2773" id="_d6565078-08a1-4b29-b311-2fc28daf2773"></a>A hierarchical section containing other sections, within a <i>StandardDocument</i>.</p>
<p class="TableTitle" style="text-align:center;">Table 11&#xA0;&#x2014; StandardHierarchicalSection attributes</p><div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;"><a name="_379a153f-0e87-4c03-840e-abb0e39145e9" id="_379a153f-0e87-4c03-840e-abb0e39145e9"></a><thead><tr><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Name</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Definition</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Mandatory/ Optional/ Conditional</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Max Occur</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Data Type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">subsections</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Subclauses of the section.</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">O</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">N</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">
<tt>StandardSection</tt>
</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
        <div><a name="_clausesection" id="_clausesection"></a><h2>7.11<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>ClauseSection</h2><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_799ca4f6-cb30-4fce-b2b7-1ae62c2e743a" id="_799ca4f6-cb30-4fce-b2b7-1ae62c2e743a"></a>A numbered clause constituting part of the main body of a <i>StandardDocument</i>.</p>
<p class="TableTitle" style="text-align:center;">Table 12&#xA0;&#x2014; ClauseSection attributes</p><div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;"><a name="_a1cbb489-4798-4a28-adef-ab0c2726d56b" id="_a1cbb489-4798-4a28-adef-ab0c2726d56b"></a><thead><tr><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Name</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Definition</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Mandatory/ Optional/ Conditional</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Max Occur</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Data Type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">type</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Semantic class of the numbered clause.</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">O</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">1</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">
<tt>String</tt>
</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
        <div><a name="_annexsection" id="_annexsection"></a><h2>7.12<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>AnnexSection</h2><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_981002d0-0561-4a35-8b3d-e320e2297e5b" id="_981002d0-0561-4a35-8b3d-e320e2297e5b"></a>Section of document constituting an annex or appendix.</p>
<p class="TableTitle" style="text-align:center;">Table 13&#xA0;&#x2014; AnnexSection attributes</p><div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;"><a name="_767c2fa7-3df7-41da-8620-6f709c21f83a" id="_767c2fa7-3df7-41da-8620-6f709c21f83a"></a><thead><tr><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Name</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Definition</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Mandatory/ Optional/ Conditional</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Max Occur</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Data Type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">subsections</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Subsections of the annex. Added explicitly because AnnexSection permits hanging paragraphs
(top-level blocks are included in the section alongside subsections).</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">O</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">N</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">
<tt>ClauseSection</tt>
</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
        <div><a name="_standardreferencessection" id="_standardreferencessection"></a><h2>7.13<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>StandardReferencesSection</h2><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_40464344-9574-4728-b42a-9687583dc3c5" id="_40464344-9574-4728-b42a-9687583dc3c5"></a>The <tt>StandardReferencesSection</tt> class within <i>StandardDocument</i>
is used to represent a bibliography section.
It is used to collate references within the document, where
there could be one or more of such sections within a document.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_888bd7d2-3dea-4b86-96ea-98c7c954eab5" id="_888bd7d2-3dea-4b86-96ea-98c7c954eab5"></a>For example, some standardization documents differentiate
normative or informative references, some split references into
sections organized by concept relevance.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_0b018141-00bc-4091-85c6-7751f204e618" id="_0b018141-00bc-4091-85c6-7751f204e618"></a>Similar to the <tt>ReferencesSection</tt> of the <i>BasicDocument</i> model,
they are leaf nodes which contain zero or more
bibliographical references (as modelled in Relaton), along with
any prefatory text.</p>
<p class="TableTitle" style="text-align:center;">Table 14&#xA0;&#x2014; StandardReferencesSection attributes</p><div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;"><a name="_fe7fbbc8-6fc7-48e9-a872-af332f9a0c48" id="_fe7fbbc8-6fc7-48e9-a872-af332f9a0c48"></a><thead><tr><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Name</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Definition</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Mandatory/ Optional/ Conditional</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Max Occur</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Data Type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">normative</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">Whether the references in the current section are normative or informative for the document.</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">O</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">1</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">
<tt>Boolean</tt>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">references</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">Bibliographic items cited in the document.</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">O</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">N</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">
<tt>BibliographicItem</tt>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">note</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Annotations accompanying bibliographic items.</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">O</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">N</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">
<tt>ParagraphBlock</tt>
</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
        <div><a name="_clausehierarchicalsection" id="_clausehierarchicalsection"></a><h2>7.14<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>ClauseHierarchicalSection</h2><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_ab3a736d-9039-4025-885f-9aa249adfa43" id="_ab3a736d-9039-4025-885f-9aa249adfa43"></a>Clauses in which all textual content belongs in a strict clause hierarchy. such that no blocks of text
are siblings to subclauses.</p>
<p class="TableTitle" style="text-align:center;">Table 15&#xA0;&#x2014; ClauseHierarchicalSection attributes</p><div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;"><a name="_adac3125-b439-4b4c-8f21-4dd420d510d9" id="_adac3125-b439-4b4c-8f21-4dd420d510d9"></a><thead><tr><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Name</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Definition</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Mandatory/ Optional/ Conditional</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Max Occur</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Data Type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">subsections</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Subclauses which are mutually exclusive with text content.</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">O</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">N</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">
<tt>ClauseHierarchicalSection</tt>
</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
        <div><a name="_standardcontentsection" id="_standardcontentsection"></a><h2>7.15<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>StandardContentSection</h2><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_a6b1811f-4af1-41db-8d83-9477c3bd1c0e" id="_a6b1811f-4af1-41db-8d83-9477c3bd1c0e"></a>An unnumbered clause, outside the main body of text of a <i>StandardDocument</i>.</p>
<p class="TableTitle" style="text-align:center;">Table 16&#xA0;&#x2014; StandardContentSection attributes</p><div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;"><a name="_677ba337-84ed-45af-893d-7b0f230ab80f" id="_677ba337-84ed-45af-893d-7b0f230ab80f"></a><thead><tr><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Name</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Definition</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Mandatory/ Optional/ Conditional</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Max Occur</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Data Type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">type</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">The type of content provided in the section, used as a semantic classification.</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">O</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">1</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">
<tt>String</tt>
</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
        <div><a name="_normativetype" id="_normativetype"></a><h2>7.16<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>NormativeType</h2>

<p class="TableTitle" style="text-align:center;">Table 17&#xA0;&#x2014; NormativeType values</p><div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;"><a name="_87a508f8-50f5-4bc6-a9cc-ced084719ec1" id="_87a508f8-50f5-4bc6-a9cc-ced084719ec1"></a><thead><tr><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Name</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Definition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">unstructured</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">The force of a clause of text in a <i>StandardDocument</i>.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">normative</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">The content in this section has normative effect.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">informative</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">The content in this section has informative effect.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
</div>
      </div>
      <div><a name="standardsreferencessection" id="standardsreferencessection"></a>
        <h1>8<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Citation and reference elements</h1>
        <div><a name="_purpose_3" id="_purpose_3"></a><h2>8.1<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Purpose</h2>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_a3168728-c52b-4cfc-993e-c6767b7b2999" id="_a3168728-c52b-4cfc-993e-c6767b7b2999"></a>Standardization documents often cite other documents within,
and as a result they usually contain one or more bibliography sections
indicating its data sources. Bibliography sections may be differentiated
as being normative or informative.</p>
</div>
        <div><a name="_standardreferencessection_2" id="_standardreferencessection_2"></a><h2>8.2<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>StandardReferencesSection</h2><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_24d42442-d21a-419f-b34d-b28796d11058" id="_24d42442-d21a-419f-b34d-b28796d11058"></a>The <tt>StandardReferencesSection</tt> class within <i>StandardDocument</i>
is used to represent a bibliography section.
It is used to collate references within the document, where
there could be one or more of such sections within a document.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_d131a440-8843-41e0-b8eb-620ee3f6fb10" id="_d131a440-8843-41e0-b8eb-620ee3f6fb10"></a>For example, some standardization documents differentiate
normative or informative references, some split references into
sections organized by concept relevance.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_7976c3d0-1170-417a-888f-96d20dfa8c53" id="_7976c3d0-1170-417a-888f-96d20dfa8c53"></a>Similar to the <tt>ReferencesSection</tt> of the <i>BasicDocument</i> model,
they are leaf nodes which contain zero or more
bibliographical references (as modelled in Relaton), along with
any prefatory text.</p>
<p class="TableTitle" style="text-align:center;">Table 18&#xA0;&#x2014; StandardReferencesSection attributes</p><div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;"><a name="_8b10256e-1188-44fa-b5bb-62170d6a37d1" id="_8b10256e-1188-44fa-b5bb-62170d6a37d1"></a><thead><tr><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Name</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Definition</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Mandatory/ Optional/ Conditional</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Max Occur</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Data Type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">normative</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">Whether the references in the current section are normative or informative for the document.</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">O</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">1</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">
<tt>Boolean</tt>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">references</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">Bibliographic items cited in the document.</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">O</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">N</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">
<tt>BibliographicItem</tt>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">note</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Annotations accompanying bibliographic items.</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">O</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">N</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">
<tt>ParagraphBlock</tt>
</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
        <div><a name="_reference_item" id="_reference_item"></a><h2>8.3<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Reference item</h2><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_b30013d7-2d3d-4d63-a27f-cd1f9e736772" id="_b30013d7-2d3d-4d63-a27f-cd1f9e736772"></a>Each reference item is represented using the <tt>BibliographicItem</tt>
class defined in <a href="#relaton">CC 6900</a>.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_9d8dbbb1-f32c-4a93-b177-9a774a562b9a" id="_9d8dbbb1-f32c-4a93-b177-9a774a562b9a"></a>It is not necessary to specialize reference items amongst
documents from different standardization bodies as a document
can cite documents of any type.</p></div>
        <div><a name="_citation" id="_citation"></a><h2>8.4<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Citation</h2><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_db6e1b9d-532a-4f05-a0e1-ea3b23a06632" id="_db6e1b9d-532a-4f05-a0e1-ea3b23a06632"></a>Each citation is represented by the <tt>Citation</tt> class defined in
<a href="#relaton">CC 6900</a>.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_ecf68fd7-ddb6-48c8-a4c0-5844b92cbb29" id="_ecf68fd7-ddb6-48c8-a4c0-5844b92cbb29"></a>It is not necessary to specialize citations since it is simply
a document data element reference linked to a reference item.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div><a name="terms" id="terms"></a>
        <h1>9<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Terms and definition elements</h1>
        <div><a name="_purpose_4" id="_purpose_4"></a><h2>9.1<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Purpose</h2>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_626f43f5-bf18-484a-9ebd-fb36801a5952" id="_626f43f5-bf18-484a-9ebd-fb36801a5952"></a>Standardization documents are used to convey normative information;
to achieve so it is imperative to provide a standardized set of
terms and definitions.</p>
</div>
        <div><a name="_general_3" id="_general_3"></a><h2>9.2<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>General</h2><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_a724f76f-14b9-444c-8dc8-001915fdbb4a" id="_a724f76f-14b9-444c-8dc8-001915fdbb4a"></a>The <i>StandardDocument</i> model provides two further subclasses of
clause sections (<tt>ClauseSection</tt>):</p>

<p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo20;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">
Definition section, and
</p>
<p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo20;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">
Term section.
</p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_57f358f3-f7ac-4f9c-bb3e-1cab97b483d3" id="_57f358f3-f7ac-4f9c-bb3e-1cab97b483d3"></a>Both types of section can include prefatory text.</p></div>
        <div><a name="_definitionsection" id="_definitionsection"></a><h2>9.3<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>DefinitionSection</h2><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_67757515-3353-4b57-a449-69ae70713c00" id="_67757515-3353-4b57-a449-69ae70713c00"></a>Definition sections consist of one or more definition lists (<tt>DefinitionCollection</tt>),
are used to define symbols and
abbreviations used in the remainder of the document.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_9099f26f-e0c9-4f9f-bed1-2e9158884f67" id="_9099f26f-e0c9-4f9f-bed1-2e9158884f67"></a>They can also be used as glossaries, with simple definitions,
in contrast to the more elaborate definitions given in
terms sections.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_ede83e3b-3ede-4184-b411-cab78d91fd94" id="_ede83e3b-3ede-4184-b411-cab78d91fd94"></a>In addition to allowing prefatory text per section, each definition list
within each definition section can also be preceded by prefatory text.</p>
<p class="TableTitle" style="text-align:center;">Table 19&#xA0;&#x2014; DefinitionSection attributes</p><div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;"><a name="_b540b523-7522-4ca4-9431-2774142b2cc3" id="_b540b523-7522-4ca4-9431-2774142b2cc3"></a><thead><tr><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Name</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Definition</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Mandatory/ Optional/ Conditional</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Max Occur</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Data Type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">definitions</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Definition list.</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">M</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">N</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">
<tt>DefinitionCollection</tt>
</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
        <div><a name="_definitioncollection" id="_definitioncollection"></a><h2>9.4<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>DefinitionCollection</h2><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_87b6d514-e575-4b52-b251-3aa547565ad9" id="_87b6d514-e575-4b52-b251-3aa547565ad9"></a>Collection of definitions, constituting the core content of a DefinitionSection.</p>
