        <div><a name="_termssection" id="_termssection"></a><h2>9.6<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>TermsSection</h2><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_019ef13f-eeae-419b-9091-6d844e6e9b30" id="_019ef13f-eeae-419b-9091-6d844e6e9b30"></a>Term sections (<tt>TermsSection</tt>) give elaborated definitions of terms used in
