        <div><a name="_term_2" id="_term_2"></a><h2>9.8<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Term</h2><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_0cfed35f-95ed-4fd0-b1c8-5981cdfd1173" id="_0cfed35f-95ed-4fd0-b1c8-5981cdfd1173"></a>A term (<tt>Term</tt>) represents a terminology entry with
its definition.</p><div class="Note"><a name="_20540931-7cae-41fd-871a-d173a88b38ef" id="_20540931-7cae-41fd-871a-d173a88b38ef"></a><p class="Note"><span class="note_label">NOTE</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>The <tt>Term</tt> definition fully aligns with the structure
and requirements of terms in ISO/IEC DIR 2, 16.6.</p></div>

<p class="TableTitle" style="text-align:center;">Table 23&#xA0;&#x2014; Term attributes</p><div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;"><a name="_9b2abb9d-a84f-4b37-9d8b-63519d01bc31" id="_9b2abb9d-a84f-4b37-9d8b-63519d01bc31"></a><thead><tr><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Name</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Definition</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Mandatory/ Optional/ Conditional</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Max Occur</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Data Type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">id</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">An optional identifier for the term, to be used in
