        <div><a name="_nested_sections" id="_nested_sections"></a><h2>9.13<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Nested sections</h2><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_c8579adf-c4af-49b0-be0c-2980623ae0aa" id="_c8579adf-c4af-49b0-be0c-2980623ae0aa"></a>Both definition and term sections are leaf nodes, and cannot
contain subclauses of their own.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_73d039c3-45f6-4336-93e9-b91cb866b564" id="_73d039c3-45f6-4336-93e9-b91cb866b564"></a>Nested definition and term sections should be modelled as
<tt>ClauseSection</tt>s with subclauses, terminating in
definition and term sections.</p></div>
